            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Séance 0.3.26

Accounts settings reliably discovers installed Claude and Codex commands when Séance opens from Finder or the Dock.

Compact account rows show Connected or a direct Sign In action. Editing and terminal commands are in each account’s menu. A shared provider error appears once, and the refresh button checks every account again.

Existing accounts, login modes, terminal commands and credentials are retained.
]]></description>
